he municipal solid waste (MSW) sector. It also offers engineering, procurement, and construction services; project management consultancy; and commissioning and recommissioning services. In addition, the company provides waste management consulting services for feasibility and DPR preparation, lender/owners engineering, and operational troubleshooting; and laboratory services for feedstock sampling and analysis, compost analysis, and digester analysis. Further, it offers segregation lines for MSW and dry waste segregation; anaerobic digesters and allied equipment; Marut drums for pulverising and recovery; and Sanjeevak carbonisation systems, a biomass-to-charcoal conversion system. The company serves project developers, municipal corporations, corporate institutions, and bulk generators. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Navi Mumbai, India."}}